[162.717818, "o", "Lead reviewer S. Patel opened working paper WP-1463 after HR finance reported that payroll accrual true-up distorted the May journal reconciliation. The team reconstructed mailbox ordering and found mailbox ingestion lag affecting at least 24 transaction threads.\r\n"]
