[180.10378, "o", " compared compliance mail timestamps against post-correction effective dates when flagging holds. Brief 09 later in this archive supersedes that draft practice for production reconciliation.\r\n485:Treasury liaison M. Chen explained that payroll accrual true-up related wires were paused during May journal, delaying compliance responses and amplifying status precedence inversion on rejected rows.\r\n487:Grant compliance WP-4415 tied payroll accrual true-up attestation gaps to ledger slice confusion visible only when hold flags used corrected rather than pre-correction ledger dates.\r\n489:Lead reviewer S. Patel opened working paper WP-1463 after HR finance reported that payroll accrual true-up distorted the May journal reconciliation. The team reconstructed mailbox ordering and found mailbox ingestion lag affecting at least 24 transaction threads.\r\n493:Platform engineer K. Morales noted that payroll accrual true-up webhook retries duplicated compliance messages in the investigative export, requiring deduplication by"]
