[214.094764, "o", "213:## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence\r\n224:## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence — supporting chronology\r\n389:## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing\r\n401:## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing — supporting chronology\r\n566:## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence\r\n578:## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence — supporting chronology\r\n689:## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners\r\n700:## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners — supporting chronology\r\n879:## Investigation Brief 06 — Effective Dates on Output\r\n891:## Investigation Brief 06 — Effective Dates on Output — supporting chronology\r\n1002:## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I)\r\n1015:## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I) — supporting chronology\r\n1180:## Investigation Brief 08 — Exception Flags (Part II)\r\n1191:## Investigation Brief 08 — Exception Flags (Part II) — supporting chrono"]
