[376.761534, "o", "3:## Investigation Brief 01 — Ledger Sourcing\r\n20:## Investigation Brief 01 — Ledger Sourcing — supporting chronology\r\n78:## Case Study 01 — Vendor Onboarding Backlog\r\n102:## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence\r\n112:## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence — supporting chronology\r\n166:## Case Study 03 — Sox Sampling Mismatch\r\n194:## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing\r\n205:## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing — supporting chronology\r\n259:## Case Study 05 — Payroll Accrual True-Up\r\n287:## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence\r\n298:## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence — supporting chronology\r\n352:## Case Study 07 — Capital Project Capitalization\r\n380:## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners\r\n390:## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners — supporting chronology\r\n444:## Case Study 08 — Lease Modification Restatement\r\n472:## Investigation Brief 06 — Effective Dates on"]
[376.761606, "o", " Output\r\n483:## Investigation Brief 06 — Effective Dates on Output — supporting chronology\r\n537:## Case Study 10 — Inventory Obsolescence Reserve\r\n565:## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I)\r\n577:## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I) — supporting chronology\r\n631:## Case Study 11 — Grant Compliance Attestation\r\n659:## Investigation Brief 08 — Exception Flags (Part II)\r\n669:## Investigation Brief 08 — Exception Flags (Part II) — supporting chronology\r\n723:## Case Study 01 — Vendor Onboarding Backlog\r\n751:## Investigation Brief 09 — Mid-Year Amendment\r\n756:ledger date immediately before correction notices are applied — that is, the date\r\n763:## Investigation Brief 09 — Mid-Year Amendment — supporting chronology\r\n821:## Case Study 07 — Capital Project Capitalization\r\n"]
